                                "sense_id": "9c06b891-93bc-3181-b5bf-7d82bf8e9a04",
                                "text": "Comparative transcriptomic studies among petal, stamen petaloid and stamen through RNA-seq were conducted, which identified several candidate genes involved in stamen petaloid, especially some MADS-box genes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b13384f1-bab6-407e-b260-d2558a0703d2",
                                "sense_id": "9c06b891-93bc-3181-b5bf-7d82bf8e9a04",
                                "text": "One or more rows of large outer petals lying flat or undulating, with a mass of intermingled petaloids and stamens in the center."
